Error [jet.RouteMethodTokenRefused]: HTTP route method `PU RGE` is refused
  --> http_route_custom_method_invalid.jet:8:16
    |
  8 |     mux.custom("PU RGE", "/cache", handle)
    |                ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `PU RGE` is not an HTTP method token: a method is one or more letters, digits or characters of !#$%&'*+-.^_`|~
 Fix: Register a standard method with its own verb (`mux.get`), and give `custom` any other token of letters, digits and !#$%&'*+-.^_`|~.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2808
